  protocol.id: prompt-step-lowcode-replacement-scope-v1
  decision.id: prompt-step-lowcode-replacement-scope-v1
  work.source: design-prompt-step-and-lowcode-replacement-scope
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Матрица_Replacement<[
Базис:
  Каждый подконтур старого ioHasC получает strategy label и replacement surface.
Вектор:
  | Подконтур ioHasC | Strategy | Rebuild state | Replacement surface | Follow-up WorkItem |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | Prompt-step panel (Code to Step prompts) | replace | missing | Operator dashboard «Промпты» read-only view | implement-prompt-step-review-ui-mvp |
  | Agent behavior rules (rules/agent-behavior/*.bvc) | port + rebuild | implemented | rules/agent-behavior/rebuild.bvc + worker-tools.bvc + src/agentBehaviorRulesBundle.mjs | — |
  | Prompt eval / agent matrix | port | contract-only | protocols/prompt-eval-workgraph-flows-v1.bvc + optional npm scripts | optional eval; no UI MVP |
  | Step atom formatter / prompt_rule canon | rebuild | implemented | src/stepAtomFormatter.mjs, npm run lint:backlog | — |
  | Low-code generateFromCharter (agent tool) | defer + port | not in rebuild | Sidecar/CLI in ../project; rebuild documents boundary only | design-sidecar-mcp-execution-boundary |
  | Low-code scaffold CLI (arch-rules → skeleton) | port | missing | npm run scaffold:arch-rules (new CLI MVP) | implement-lowcode-scaffold-cli-mvp |
  | verify:low-code / arch guard | port | missing | npm run verify:lowcode in rebuild CI optional gate | implement-lowcode-scaffold-cli-mvp (verify hook) |
  | Bracket IR / visual low-code editor | defer | contract-only | protocols/bracket-ir-trace-envelope-v1.bvc | deferred; no operator UI |
  | Template engine (Handlebars arch-low-code) | defer | not ported | Reference ../project/templates/arch-low-code | deferred |
Цель:
  Ни один подконтур не исчезает без явного owner и surface.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  protocol.id: prompt-step-lowcode-replacement-scope-v1
  trace.status: verified
