#Boundary_UI_CLI_API<[
Базис:
  Ближайший цикл не должен тащить Monaco prompt editor или visual scaffold designer.
Вектор:
  Prompt-step MVP:
  - Surface: operator dashboard view «Промпты» (read-only)
  - Data: scan protocols/*.bvc + rules/**/*.bvc for atom.profile: prompt_rule
  - API: GET /api/prompt-rules-projection (list + detail by protocol.id/rule.id)
  - Editing: deferred → Atom Inspector proposal (implement-atom-inspector-form-mvp)
  Low-code MVP:
  - Surface: CLI only (no dashboard UI in first slice)
  - Commands: npm run scaffold:arch-rules -- --charter path [--output dir] (wrap or port minimal from ../project pattern)
  - Verification: npm run verify:lowcode as optional gate in release matrix (not ci:mandatory)
  - Agent tool generateFromCharter: defer until sidecar/MCP boundary closes
  Prompt eval:
  - Surface: CLI optional (npm run test:prompt-eval when ported); fixtures in protocols/prompt-eval-workgraph-flows-v1.bvc
  - No operator UI for eval in MVP
Цель:
  Operator видит prompt rules; low-code остаётся CLI/evidence path; eval не блокирует deterministic CI.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  protocol.id: prompt-step-lowcode-replacement-scope-v1
  decision.id: prompt-step-lowcode-ui-cli-boundary
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Замена_prompt_step_panel<[
Базис:
  Старый prompt-step tab = Monaco-side prompt list for Code to Step pipeline.
Вектор:
  | Старый ioHasC | Work Graph replacement |
  |---|---|
  | Tab «prompt-step» в console | Nav «Промпты» в operator dashboard |
  | Inline edit in panel | Read-only review MVP; edit via Atom Inspector later |
  | Mixed with code-to-step | Filter atom.profile: prompt_rule across protocols/rules |
  | Compile status in UI | show trace.status + formatter/lint hints read-only |
Цель:
  Оператор находит prompt rules без возврата к Monaco console.

